{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Armor & Helmets|$Helms & Helmets|Grand $Troll Helm}}

Grand Troll Helm is one of the best helmets in game. Giving good bonus at [[Strength]] and [[Unarmed Combat]]

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}Troll Skull + _{q}Steel}{2} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Strength *Smithing}</math>.

* Bonuses = <math>_{q10}Bonuses*\sqrt{\frac{_{q}Helm}{10}}</math>.

==Stat Formulas==

{| class="wikitable" style="text-align: center"
 ! Stat
 ! Formula
 |-
 | Wear
 | <math>Quality * 25</math>
 |-
 | Deflection
 | <math>\sqrt{\frac{Quality}{10}} * 6</math>
 |-
 | Absorption
 | <math>\sqrt{\frac{Quality}{10}} * 10</math>
 |-
 | Strength
 | <math>\sqrt{\frac{Quality}{10}} * 5</math>
 |-
 | Unarmed Combat
 | <math>\sqrt{\frac{Quality}{10}} * 10</math>
 |-
 | Agility Penalty
 | <math>\sqrt{\frac{Quality}{10}}</math>
 |}

